# Tour PATCH publish-owner dispatch (P15-P-B4)

## Problem

`apps/api/src/tours/` still hard-coded workspace branches for:

- publish-field owner assertion (`assert-tour-publish-field-owner.ts`)
- operator **member** PATCH denial (`tours.routes.ts` — Denali-only enterprise policy)

Patch merge/gates already use `workspace-tour-write-bindings.generated.ts` (Phase 10.3); P-B4 closes the remaining tour-write host branches.

## Manifest contract (`tourWrite` extensions)

| Field | Denali | Urban |
|-------|--------|-------|
| `publishOwnerAssertModule` | `./http` | `./http` |
| `publishOwnerAssertExport` | `assertDenaliWorkspaceOwner` | `assertWorkspaceOwner` |
| `forbidOperatorMemberTourPatch` | `true` | omitted |

Codegen extends `WORKSPACE_TOUR_WRITE_BINDINGS` with `assertPublishFieldOwner` and optional `forbidOperatorMemberTourPatch`.

## Host dispatch

[`workspace-tour-write-dispatch.ts`](../../apps/api/src/tours/workspace-tour-write-dispatch.ts):

| Function | Route usage |
|----------|-------------|
| `assertTourPublishFieldOwner({ auth, workspaceType, surface })` | PATCH `/tours/:id` when publish gate fires |
| `operatorMemberTourPatchForbidden(workspaceType)` | PATCH `/tours/:id` before service call |

[`assert-tour-publish-field-owner.ts`](../../apps/api/src/tours/assert-tour-publish-field-owner.ts) re-exports dispatch (legacy import path preserved).

## Out of scope (P-B4)

[`bridge-denali-operator-create-body.ts`](../../apps/api/src/tours/bridge-denali-operator-create-body.ts) — operator-smoke starter ingress bridge (SMK-P9-02); remains Denali-named until Phase 11.7 neutral create ingress lands.

## Verify

```bash
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry --check
pnpm run phase-15:platform-fast-gate
node --test apps/api/test/workspace-tour-write-dispatch.spec.ts
! rg -q 'workspaceType === "denali"' apps/api/src/tours/tours.routes.ts
! rg -q 'workspaceType === "denali"' apps/api/src/tours/assert-tour-publish-field-owner.ts
```
